HD is hit dice, which I vaguely remember from my AD&D days. Strength is
the only stat I remember changing, it usually goes up to 18/**. It is
interesting that when you die in polymorphed form, you revert to human
with no HP lost. Poly and poly control can make it quite easy to win the
game.
